 1st.</p>\n        <p class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 610.165px auto auto 151.164px; width: 780px; text-align: center; color: rgb(127, 140, 141); font-size: 24px !important; z-index: 4; line-height: 1.6; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">To ensure maximum security for our community, we are requiring Two-Factor Authentication for every login. Please update your settings to avoid lockout.</p>\n        <div class=\"hd-draggable\" data-type=\"text\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 804.634px auto auto 2.32784px; width: 1080px; text-align: center; color: rgb(41, 128, 185); font-weight: 900; font-size: 28px; z-index: 4; outline: none; cursor: grab;\" contenteditable=\"false\">SECURE YOUR ACCOUNT NOW</div>"
